<title>USA: Northern States Minn. coal unit off line.</title>
<headline>Northern States Minn. coal unit off line.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern States Power Co's 567 megawatt Allen S. King coal-fired power plant was taken out of service over the weekend for a boiler repair, the company said.</p>
<p>The unit, located near Stillwater, Minn., was taken off line on November 3 for the repair and no restart date has been set, Northern States said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Allen King unit came on line in 1968.</p>
<p>-- New York Power Desk 212-859-1627</p>
</text>
